3","marks":["code"],"text":"../Makefile"},{"id":"spn-71584","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-71585","marks":["bold"],"text":"skipped silently when absent"},{"id":"spn-71586","text":", so in every scratch tree they scanned nothing and passed. Absence is a failure now."}]},{"id":"blk-40884","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-71587","text":"Gate, this round"}]},{"id":"blk-40885","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"grid v1.24.0 — 66 entries / 351 citations      derive_protocol.mjs 0.8.0\nkernel PASS · World 0.12.0 PASS · --check-receipt PASS\nnegative battery      132/132   (fifteen new forgeries)\ncross-plane bridge     48/48\nnative semantic film   13/13    ← new\nderive battery         45/45    realm battery 19/19\nprobes  2/2+2/2 · 4/4+5/5 · 5/5 · 3/3+4/4 · 1/1+4/4 · 1/1+6/6 · 2/2+5/5\nharness self-test       9/9     runner contract 3/3\nreview pack            18/18 green from an arbitrary directory"},{"id":"blk-40886","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71588","marks":["code"],"text":"scheduler_certificate.json"},{"id":"spn-71589","text":" byte-identical — eighteenth consecutive round. The kernel gained five exports this round ("},{"id":"spn-71590","marks":["code"],"text":"replaySemFilm"},{"id":"spn-71591","text":" and the enumeration primitives), so "},{"id":"spn-71592","marks":["code"],"text":"cert_id a08ee15d…"},{"id":"spn-71593","text":" unchanged is the proof the addition was additive."}]},{"id":"blk-40887","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71594","text":"The full record is "},{"id":"spn-71595","marks":["code"],"text":"governance/round-11-ledger.md"},{"id":"spn-71596","text":", items "},{"id":"spn-71597","marks":["bold"],"text":"110–122"},{"id":"spn-71598","text":"."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraxqoy56db3xmwvqou44jjnv6pohl4dwmbse3ydrk3zhlgubtx5t2q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}